{"id":"abuelo","lemma":"abuelo","pos":"noun","rank":671,"glosses":["grandfather","an elderly person","loose tufts of hair in the nape when one's hair is messed up"],"ipa":"/aˈbwelo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"abuelos","feminine":"abuela","femininePlural":"abuelas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-abuelo.wav","formAudio":{"abuelos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-abuelos.wav","abuela":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-abuela.wav","abuelas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Haylli-abuelas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Él es mi abuelo.","en":"This is my grandfather.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461552"},{"text":"¿Cómo están tus abuelos?","en":"How are your grandparents?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594880"},{"text":"Mi abuela está enferma.","en":"My grandmother is sick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/821232"},{"text":"¿Dónde está tu abuelo?","en":"Where's your grandfather?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/548111"},{"text":"Sus dos abuelos están muertos.","en":"Both his grandfathers are dead.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645601"}]}